:: Widgets Farmland Road Events [widget]
<<widget "farmland_road_events">>
	<<cleareventpool>>

	<<if $skulduggery gte 600 and $farmland_manors isnot 1>>
		<<addevent farmland_manors_discovery>>
	<<elseif !$plants_known.includes("rice") and $tending gte 400>>
		<<addinlineevent "farmland_road_rice">>
			<<generate1>><<person1>>
			"You look like a green thumb," says a <<person>> from behind a fence. "Here." <<He>> throws a bag your way. It's full of <<foodstufficon "rice">> rice seeds. "I couldn't get them to take, and I'm sick of the sight of them. Perhaps you'll have more luck."
			<br><br>
			<span class="gold">You can now grow rice.</span>
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Farmland]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<set $plants_known.push("rice")>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<<else>>
		<<addinlineevent "farmland_road_1">>
			<<beastNEWinit 3 horse>> You hear the clop of hooves as three <<beastsplural>> gallop by, bearing their riders to parts unknown.
			<br><br>

			<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
				You hug a roadside bush to avoid them. They run through a puddle, almost splashing you as they pass.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
			<<else>>
				You hug a roadside bush to avoid them.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Farmland]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<if $farmland_manors isnot 1>>
			<<addinlineevent "farmland_road_2">>
				The road passes through a pair of stone pillars, each tipped with a stone sphere. Wild trees hang over the road, creating a tunnel.
				<br><br>
				You emerge among a small collection of buildings. It looks like a small farm, <span class="red">perhaps deserted.</span> You walk another ten minutes, and find a more familiar area.
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Next|Farmland]]>><<pass 10>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>

		<<addinlineevent "farmland_road_3">>
			You find a collection of stone buildings. One of which looks like a corner shop.
			<br><br>
			<<if $money gte 300>>
				<<link [[Buy a sweet (0:02)|Farmland Event Shop]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<link [[Ignore|Farmland]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</addinlineevent>>

		<<addinlineevent "farmland_road_4">>
			You pass a field of waist-high flowers. A footpath is marked, passing through it. It looks like a more pleasant route than the road.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Travel through the field (0:05)|Farmland Event Flowers]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -6>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Ignore|Farmland]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</addinlineevent>>

		<<addinlineevent "farmland_road_5">>
			<<generate1>><<person1>>
			"Ho there," says a <<personssimple>> voice. You look to the side, and see a <<person>> waving at you from the entrance to a farm.
			<br><br>
			"You a neighbour? I got a spare bushel of wheat for sale if you're interested," <<he>> says. "It's been in storage, but it's good. Just <<printmoney 1000>> for the lot."
			<br><br>

			<<if !$plants_known.includes("rice")>>
				"I also have rice seeds. I couldn't get them to take. The soil's no good for them. You can have them for <<printmoney 3000>>."
				<br><br>

				<<if $money gte 3000>>
					<<foodstufficon "rice">> <<link [[Buy rice seeds (£30)|Farmland Event Rice]]>><<set $plants_known.push("rice")>><<money -3000>><</link>><<gtending>>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<span class="blue">You can't afford the seeds.</span>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
			<<if $money gte 1000>>
				<<link [[Buy 50 cups of wheat (£10)|Farmland Event Wheat]]>><<tending_give "wheat" 50>><<money -1000>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<span class="blue">You can't afford the wheat.</span>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Don't buy anything|Farmland]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</addinlineevent>>

		<<addinlineevent "farmland_road_6">>
			A lorry full of timber rumbles by. The road is barely wide enough. You push yourself into a bush to make room.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Farmland]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</addinlineevent>>

		<<addinlineevent "farmland_road_7">>
			You pass an open barn. The interior is full of construction materials.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Farmland]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</addinlineevent>>

		<<addinlineevent "farmland_road_8">>
			<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
				A low shape emerges from the dark, stopping several feet away, before darting beneath a bush.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
				<br><br>
			<<else>>
				A badger runs up to you, stopping several feet away, before disappearing beneath a bush.<<lstress>><<stress -6>>
				<br><br>
			<</if>>

			<<link [[Next|Farmland]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</addinlineevent>>

		<<addinlineevent "farmland_road_9">>
			A breeze blows from the north, bringing with it the scent of the sea.<<lstress>><<stress -6>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Farmland]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</addinlineevent>>

		<<addinlineevent "farmland_road_10">>
			A hare rushes from beneath a bush, startling you.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Farmland]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</addinlineevent>>

		<<if $farmland_manors is 1 and Time.hour gte 18 and $exposed lte 0 and !$weekly.farmlandStreetManorListen>>
			<<addinlineevent "farmland_road_11">>
				<<set $weekly.farmlandStreetManorListen to true>>
				You hear loud music coming from one of the manors, and notice a bunch of cars parked near the gate. Seems someone is holding a party today.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Listen in|Farmland Event Manor Listen]]>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[Ignore|Farmland]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>

	<</if>>
	<<runeventpool>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "farmland_manors_discovery">>
	길은 끝에 돌 구체가 달린 한 쌍의 돌기둥 사이를 통과한다. 양옆으로 늘어선 나무들이 위를 덮으며 터널을 이룬다. 거칠고 투박해 보이지만, 의도적으로 이렇게 가꾸었다는 흔적이 역력하다. 길은 곧 오른쪽으로 방향을 틀어, 언덕 아래로 이어진다.
	<br><br>

	작은 건물들이 모여 있는 곳에 다다른다. 오래된 농장의 일부인 것 같지만, 화려한 증축 건물과 더 화려한 차들이 있는 것으로 보아 <span class="green">지금은 부유한 사람들의 집인 듯하다.</span> 사생활을 위해 다뉴브 가의 편의 시설을 포기할 만한 사람들. 무언가 숨길 것이 있는 사람들이 사는 곳이다.
	<br><br>

	<span class="gold">농장 저택을 발견했습니다.</span>
	<<set $farmland_manors to 1>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[침입한다|Farmland Manors Lock]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[일단 내버려둔다|Farmland]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

:: Farmland Event Wheat
<<effects>><<wearProp "wheat">>

<<person>>에게 돈을 주고 밀을 받는다.
<br><br>

<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
	"날씨가 개면 좋겠군요." <<he>>【은는】 모자를 눈썹까지 눌러쓰며 말한다.
<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "snow">>
	"곧 따뜻해지면 좋겠군요." <<he>>【은는】 몸을 떨며 말한다.
<<else>>
	"좋은 하루 보내세요." <<he>>【은는】 농장으로 돌아보며 말한다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Farmland]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Farmland Event Rice
<<effects>><<wearProp "rice">>

<<person>>에게 돈을 주고 씨앗 한 봉지를 받는다.
<br><br>

"나보다 운이 더 좋길 바라오." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "행운을 비오."
<br><br>

<span class="gold">이제 쌀을 재배할 수 있습니다.</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Farmland]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Farmland Event Shop
<<effects>>

<<generate1>><<person1>>
가게에 들어서자 카운터 뒤에서 <<person>>【이가】 당신을 보고 미소 짓는다.
<br><br>

선반에는 식료품, 음료, 세면도구가 진열되어 있다. 마을 주민들이 시내까지 나가지 않아도 되도록 일상용품을 구비해 둔 것이다. 그중에서도 유독 눈길을 끄는 가판대가 있다. 사탕을 파는 곳이다.
<br><br>

<<if $money gte 300>>
	<<link [[막대사탕 구매하기 (£3)|Farmland Event Shop Lollipop]]>><<stress -6>><<money -300>><</link>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">막대사탕을 살 돈이 부족합니다.</span>
<</if>>
<br>
<<if $money gte 500>>
	<<link [[민트 사탕 한 통 구매하기 (£5)|Farmland Event Shop Mints]]>><<stress -6>><<money -500>><</link>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">민트 사탕을 살 돈이 부족합니다.</span>
<</if>>
<br>
<<if $money gte 1000>>
	<<link [[고급 초콜릿 바 구매하기 (£10)|Farmland Event Shop Chocolate]]>><<stress -6>><<money -1000>><</link>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">고급 초콜릿을 살 돈이 부족합니다.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[떠나기|Farmland]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Farmland Event Shop Lollipop
<<effects>>

<<if random(1, 1000) gte 1000>>
	<<wearProp "lollipop big">>
	유독 한 막대사탕이 눈에 띈다. 낫 모양이다. 당신은 그것을 사서 가게를 나오며 핥는다. 놀라울 정도로 달콤하다.<<ltrauma>><<trauma -6>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<wearProp "lollipop small">>
	막대사탕을 하나 골라 계산대에서 돈을 낸다. 가게를 나오며 핥는다. 놀라울 정도로 달콤하다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Farmland]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Farmland Event Shop Mints
<<effects>><<wearProp "mints">>

<<person>>에게서 민트 사탕 한 통을 사서, 가게를 나오며 몇 개를 입에 던져 넣는다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Farmland]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Farmland Event Shop Chocolate
<<effects>><<wearProp "chocolate">><<canvas-model-override "mouth" "chew">>

초콜릿 바를 하나 집는다. "제가 제일 좋아하는 거예요." 당신이 돈을 건네자 <<person>>【이가】 말한다.
<br><br>
가게를 나오면서 조금씩 베어 문다. 쌉쌀한 맛이 나지만 불쾌하지는 않다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Farmland]]>><<canvas-model-override "clear">><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Farmland Event Flowers
<<effects>>

꽃밭을 가로질러 우회한다. 길은 거의 보이지 않는다. 지나갈 때마다 꽃잎이 당신을 간지럽힌다.
<br><br>

<<if $rng gte 91>>
	<<if $settings.bestialityEnabled and $settings.lurkersEnabled>>
		옆에서 바스락거리는 소리가 들린다. 무언가가 인간이 아닌 속도로 식물 사이를 헤치며 움직인다. 당신을 향해 똑바로 오고 있다.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Farmland Event Flowers Lurker]]>><<set $struggle_start to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		옆에서 바스락거리는 소리가 들린다. 무언가가 인간이 아닌 속도로 식물 사이를 헤치며 움직인다. 당신을 향해 똑바로 오고 있다.
		<br><br>

		당신은 돌아서서 달린다. 간신히 탈출했지만, 상처 없이 벗어나지는 못했다.
		<<beastescape>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Farmland]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if $worn.under_lower.type.includes("naked") and !$worn.lower.type.includes("naked")>>
		<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 3) and $worn.upper.set isnot $worn.lower.set>>
			<span class="lewd">음란한 생각이 떠오른다.</span> 식물들이 허리 아래를 가려준다.
			<br><br>
			<<link [["" + $worn.lower.name + " 벗기"|Farmland Event Flowers Lower]]>><</link>><<exhibitionist 3>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif !$worn.under_lower.type.includes("naked") and !$worn.lower.type.includes("naked")>>
		<<if $worn.upper.set isnot $worn.lower.set>>
			<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 2)>>
				<span class="lewd">음란한 생각이 떠오른다.</span> 식물들이 허리 아래를 가려준다.
				<br><br>
				<<link [["" + $worn.lower.name + " 벗기"|Farmland Event Flowers Under]]>><</link>><<exhibitionist 2>>
				<br>
				<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 3) and $worn.under_upper.set isnot $worn.under_lower.set>>
					<<link [["" + $worn.lower.name + "【와과】 " + $worn.under_lower.name + " 벗기"|Farmland Event Flowers Lower Under]]>><</link>><<exhibitionist 3>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>

	<<link [[계속해서 밭을 가로지른다|Farmland]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Farmland Event Flowers Lurker
<<effects>>

<<if $struggle_start is 1>>
	<<struggle_init>>
	<<set $struggle.creature to "lurker">>/*Creature species*/
	<<struggle_creatures 1 2>>/*How many creatures will be involved, and their health.*/
	<<set $combat to 1>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<if $player.sex is "h">>
		<<if random(1, 2) is 2>>
			<<set $struggle.penis.creature to "lurker">><<set $penisuse to "struggle">><<set $penisstate to "struggle">><<set $struggle.enemy[0].location to "penis">>
		<<else>>
			<<set $struggle.vagina.creature to "lurker">><<set $vaginause to "struggle">><<set $vaginastate to "struggle">><<set $struggle.enemy[0].location to "vagina">>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $player.penisExist is true>>
		<<set $struggle.penis.creature to "lurker">><<set $penisuse to "struggle">><<set $penisstate to "struggle">><<set $struggle.enemy[0].location to "penis">>
	<<else>>
		<<set $struggle.vagina.creature to "lurker">><<set $vaginause to "struggle">><<set $vaginastate to "struggle">><<set $struggle.enemy[0].location to "vagina">>
	<</if>>
	<<set $timer to 12>>
	<<unset $struggle_start>>
<</if>>

<<struggle>>

<<if $struggle.done gte $struggle.number>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Farmland Event Flowers Lurker End]]>><</link>></span>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Farmland Event Flowers Lurker]]>><</link>></span>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Farmland Event Flowers Lurker End
<<effects>>

<<if $lurkers_held gte 1>>
	당신은 잡은 럴커를 살펴본다. 채집망이 럴커를 단단히 붙잡고 있다.
<<else>>
	럴커가 꽃들 사이로 사라진다.
<</if>>
 <<tearful>> 당신은 계속해서 밭을 가로지른다.
<br><br>

<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>

<<link [[다음|Farmland]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Farmland Event Flowers Lower
<<effects>>

<<generate1>><<person1>>
$worn.lower.name【을를】 벗어 들고 계속해서 밭을 가로지른다. 인접한 밭에서 일하던 <<person>>【이가】 지나가는 당신을 보고 손을 흔든다. 당신은 빈손으로 답례한다.
<<exhibitionism3>>
<<lowerstrip>>
밭을 건너자마자 몰래 옷을 입는다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Farmland]]>><<clotheson>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Farmland Event Flowers Lower Under
<<effects>>

<<generate1>><<person1>>
$worn.lower.name【와과】 $worn.under_lower.name【을를】 벗어 들고 계속해서 밭을 가로지른다. 인접한 밭에서 일하던 <<person>>【이가】 지나가는 당신을 보고 손을 흔든다. 당신은 빈손으로 답례한다.
<<exhibitionism3>>
<<lowerstrip>><<underlowerstrip>>
밭을 건너자마자 몰래 옷을 입는다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Farmland]]>><<clotheson>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Farmland Event Flowers Under
<<effects>>

<<generate1>><<person1>>
$worn.lower.name【을를】 벗어 들고 계속해서 밭을 가로지른다. 인접한 밭에서 일하던 <<person>>【이가】 지나가는 당신을 보고 손을 흔든다. 당신은 빈손으로 답례한다.
<<exhibitionism2>>
<<lowerstrip>>
밭을 건너자마자 몰래 옷을 입는다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Farmland]]>><<clotheson>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>
:: Farmland Event Manor Listen
<<effects>>

<<if $rng gte 26>>
	After some time you can hear desperate screams drowned out by music. <<gstress>><<stress 4>><<gtrauma>><<trauma 2>>
	<br><br>
	You take another look at the cars and realise you could not help even if you wanted to. Best to move on.
<<else>>
	You hear people laughing and dancing. It’s comforting. <<lstress>><<stress -4>><<ltrauma>><<trauma -2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farmland]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>
